# Data-suffixed run outputs (npz, jsonl) exceed the 64 KB data-file policy and the artifact store refuses
# uploads from this runtime. They stay on the run host; each lead commits SHA256 sums and lossless .json
# mirrors (under 1 MB each) after its run.
**/data/**/*.npz
**/data/**/*.jsonl
**/data/*.npz
**/out/*.npz
